              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ils ont pendu la crémaillère samedi soir. They had their house-warming on Saturday night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Pendre la crémaillère — to throw a house-warming party; once, hanging the pot-hook over the fire was the last step of moving in."
            }
